peIgnoreComments` instead of `reportUnnecessaryTypeIgnoreComment`) so the unnecessary-type-ignore check was silently disabled. Fixing the setting name exposed ~300 errors.\n\nAll bare `# pyright: ignore` comments have been replaced with specific rules (e.g. `# pyright: ignore[reportReturnType]`). Stale references to renamed rules like `reportGeneralTypeIssues` have been removed.\n\nFor files where `# type: ignore` is required by mypy but not pyright, a per-file `# pyright: reportUnnecessaryTypeIgnoreComment=false` directive is added to suppress the false positive — pyright flags mypy's `# type: ignore` as unnecessary when it doesn't see an error on that line.\n\n<!-- docs-preview -->\n\n<hr>\n📚 Documentation preview 📚: https://litestar-org.github.io/litestar-docs-preview/4689\n","labels":[{"id":6793929611,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGfceZM8AAAABlPMjiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litestar-org/litestar/labels/pr/internal","name":"pr/internal","description":null,"color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6795700013,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGfceZM8AAAABlQ4nLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litestar-org/litestar/labels/area/handlers","name":"area/handlers","description":"This PR involves changes to the handlers","color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6795700019,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGfceZM8AAAABlQ4nMw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litestar-org/litestar/labels/area/private-api","name":"area/private-api","description":"This PR involves changes to the privatized API","color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6796662816,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGfceZM8AAAABlRzYIA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/litestar-org/litestar/labels/area/dependencies","name":"area/dependencies","description":"This PR involves changes to the dependencies","color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6796807274,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGfceZM8AAAABlR8Mag","url":"https://