as\nsilently disabled. Fixing the name exposed ~300 errors.\n\nAll bare `# pyright: ignore` comments have been replaced with specific\nrules, e.g. `# pyright: ignore[reportReturnType]`. Stale references to\nrenamed rules like `reportGeneralTypeIssues` have been removed.\n\nFor files where `# type: ignore` is needed by mypy but not pyright,\na per-file `# pyright: reportUnnecessaryTypeIgnoreComment=false`\ndirective suppresses the false positive since pyright flags mypy's\n`# type: ignore` syntax as unnecessary.","commit_title":"chore: fix pyright type-ignore comments to use specific error codes (#4689)","merge_method":"squash","enabled_by":{"login":"cofin","id":204685,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDY4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204685?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin","html_url":"https://github.com/cofin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},"draft":false,"merged":true,"mergeable":null,"rebaseable":null,"mergeable_state":"unknown","merged_by":{"login":"cofin","id":204685,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDY4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204685?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin","html_url":"https://github.com/cofin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cofin/following{/ot